              <div class="mdl-cell mdl-cell--12-col-desktop mdl-cell--12-col-tablet blog" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Blog">
	
			<h1 class="mdl-cell mdl-cell--12-col-desktop mdl-cell--12-col-tablet"> 							<span class="subheading-category">Voter registration</span>
					</h1>
		    
            <div class="category-desc clearfix">
                                                    <p><img style="float: left;" src="/files/voters/armadillo-voter-registration-logo.png" alt="register, be counted, vote logo" width="303" height="303" />The voter registration division is located at 2433 Ridgepoint Drive and is open from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., Monday through Friday. Use the building's main entrance and take the elevator to the second floor. We are to the right as you step off the elevator.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Residents and volunteer deputy registrars looking to conduct voter registration business can <a href="/visit-us" target="_self">visit our main office</a> during normal business hours without an appointment to register to vote and to pick-up or drop-off volunteer deputy registrar materials. In addition, residents and volunteer deputy registrars may also <a href="/visit-us" target="_self">visit one of our satellite locations</a> to register to vote or drop-off voter registration applications.</p>
<p>For questions or comments, please email: <joomla-hidden-mail  is-link="1" is-email="1" first="VGF4X1ZvdGVycw==" last="VHJhdmlzQ291bnR5VHguZ292" text="VGF4X1ZvdGVyc0BUcmF2aXNDb3VudHlUeC5nb3Y=" base="" >This email address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it.</joomla-hidden-mail>, or call 512-854-9473.</p>
<p>Did you know you can verify your voter record online? You can also view your personal sample ballot, identify a polling location, confirm election dates and times, and more! Just visit <a href="https://www.VoteTravis.com" target="_self">www.VoteTravis.com</a>&nbsp;for everything voting!</p>                                </div>
    
                
    
    
    
        </div>

               
              <!--div style="display:flex"-->
              


	<div class="mdl-card mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-cell mdl-cell--4-col mdl-cell--4-col-tablet mdl-cell--6-col-desktop">
<div class="mdl-card-header-cont">
<div class="mdl-card__title">
<h2 class="mdl-card__title-text">Register to vote</h2>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mdl-card__supporting-text">Learn how you can register to vote.</div>
<div class="mdl-card__actions"><a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect" href="/voters/registration" aria-label="learn more on how you can register to vote" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">Learn More</a> <br /><a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect green-button" href="https://vrapp.sos.state.tx.us/index.asp" target="_blank" rel="aria-label= noopener" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">FILL OUT APPLICATION <i class="material-icons">launch</i><span class="mdl-button__ripple-container"><span class="mdl-ripple"><br /></span></span></a> <a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect green-button" href="https://elections.traviscountytx.gov/voter-information/voter-lookup/#VoterEligibilitySearch" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="find out if you are registered" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">Find Out if You Are Registered <i class="material-icons"> launch</i></a></div>
</div>



	<div class="mdl-card mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-cell mdl-cell--4-col mdl-cell--4-col-tablet mdl-cell--6-col-desktop">
<div class="mdl-card-header-cont">
<div class="mdl-card__title">
<h2 class="mdl-card__title-text">Volunteer deputy registrars</h2>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mdl-card__supporting-text">Learn how you can become a volunteer deputy registrar.</div>
<div class="mdl-card__actions"><a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect" href="/voters/volunteer-deputy-registrars" aria-label="learn more on how you can become a volunteer deputy voter registrar" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">Learn More</a> <a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect green-button" href="https://campsite.bio/tcvdr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="sign up for training" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">Sign up for Training<i class="material-icons">launch</i><span class="mdl-button__ripple-container"><span class="mdl-ripple"></span></span></a> <a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect green-button" href="https://forms.gle/S7W2ZLwbhThg3irr5" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="sign up for training" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple">Request Reciprocity launch&nbsp;<i class="material-icons">launch</i><span class="mdl-button__ripple-container"><span class="mdl-ripple"></span></span></a></div>
</div>



	<div class="mdl-card mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-cell mdl-cell--4-col mdl-cell--4-col-tablet mdl-cell--6-col-desktop">
<div class="mdl-card-header-cont">
<div class="mdl-card__title">
<h2 class="mdl-card__title-text">Voter registration geospatial data, maps, and reports</h2>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mdl-card__supporting-text">View and download voter registration geospatial data, maps, and reports</div>
<div class="mdl-card__actions"><a class="mdl-button mdl-shadow--2dp mdl-js-button mdl-js-ripple-effect" href="https://voter-registration-maps-traviscountytx.hub.arcgis.com/" aria-label="go to registered voters data portal" data-upgraded=",MaterialButton,MaterialRipple" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More</a></div>
</div>
 
